From: Sukrit Jaidee <45908411+SukritJaAIproject@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:05:14 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): generate the colours the new tabs use (1.7.1)

withMT replaces Tailwind's palette with Material Tailwind's, which has no
slate, emerald, violet, sky or rose; no CSS was generated for those classes.
In 1.7.0 the Ground Truth "Save & next file" and Train Model "Train
candidate" buttons rendered white on white. Add the five families to the
theme and a test that fails when a dashboard file uses a colour family the
resolved Tailwind theme does not generate. Version 1.7.1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
